            "review_title": "Review at Mountain Food & Drink",
            "review_text": "Casablanca88\nDa Nang, Vietnam10 contributions\n0\nA Pleasant Dining Stop with Good Food and Friendly Service\nAug 2025\nI had the chance to visit Mountain Food & Drink during my recent trip, and it turned out to be a pleasant stop. The restaurant is conveniently located, easy to find, with a quiet and breezy surrounding. Inside, the atmosphere feels cozy, with tidy and clean seating arrangements.\n\nThe menu is not overly extensive but offers enough variety to choose from. The food was well-seasoned, made with fresh ingredients, and neatly presented. I especially enjoyed the grilled meat and fresh vegetables, which felt carefully prepared. The drinks were also nice—coffee was rich and aromatic.\n\nThe staff were friendly, polite, and willing to answer questions or give recommendations when asked. The waiting time for food was reasonable, not too long. Prices, in my opinion, are fair for the quality offered—not the cheapest, but worth it.\n\nOverall, Mountain Food & Drink offers a comfortable and welcoming dining experience, suitable for both travelers and locals looking for simple but quality meals. If I return to this area, I would be happy to visit again.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nGood food & service friendly . I like it\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 14, 2025",
